            en: 'The lesson is blunt: an unauthorized attack can be a crime however educational the intent, and the scope-and-permission document is part of engineering practice, not a formality. Validation stays yours after the tool: reproduce the finding and judge its real impact — agents over-report, miss logic flaws, and hallucinate.',
